## 1. OpenCode Console v2 Quota Client & Parser

- [x] 1.1 Update `pkg/sdk/providers/opencode/client.go` to request `GET https://opencode.ai/console/api/go/status` with `Accept: application/json` and `x-org-id: <WorkspaceID>`, plus add `FetchDefaultOrgID` helper for `/console/api/orgs`.
- [x] 1.2 Extend `pkg/sdk/providers/opencode/parser.go` to parse the Console v2 JSON response (`access.meters.{fiveHour, week, month}` with `usedMicroCents`, `limitMicroCents`, and nullable `resetsAt`), handling `access: null` as `Lapsed: true` and failing closed on invalid/negative values.
- [x] 1.3 Add unit tests in `pkg/sdk/providers/opencode/parser_test.go` and `client_test.go` covering Console v2 active meters, unstarted 5h window (`resetsAt: null`), lapsed subscription (`access: null`), malformed micro-cents, and HTTP header verification.

## 2. OpenCode Console v2 Browser Auth & Account Page

